{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"duration","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP8DurationQa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clock","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP8DurationQa"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customError","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"text":")? = nil) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timeout","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Clock","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"duration","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The longest the sequence may go without an element."}]}]},{"name":"clock","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clock that measures the gaps."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"tolerance","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tolerance of the timer’s sleeps. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"customError","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The error to throw when the timer fires. Defaults to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"TimeoutError.timedOut(duration:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A sequence of the same elements that throws if the upstream goes quiet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The timer starts when iteration begins and restarts with every element, so it bounds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wait for the first element and each gap after it, never the sequence as a whole. Elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass through unchanged. When the timer fires, the upstream is cancelled and the sequence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws, without waiting for the upstream to respond to the cancellation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws before the first element."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let clock = ContinuousClock()","for try await line in bytes.lines.timeout(.seconds(30), clock: clock) {","    handle(line)","}"]},{"name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customError"},{"type":"text","text":") when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"duration"},{"type":"text","text":" passes between elements, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any error the upstream throws."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/outputin\/timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customerror:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputIn\/timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customError:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputIn"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fails if the sequence goes the given duration without producing an element, measured on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the given clock."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE7timeout_5clock9tolerance11customErrorAA14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutVy_xqd__G8DurationQyd___qd__AOSgs0H0_pSgt12_Concurrency5ClockRd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO8OutputInV","title":"timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customErr